msgid ""
"Some jerk from the Nishikiyama Family said he needed to talk to the owner, "
"so they tossed everyone out. Even me! Me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Did you say Nishikiyama...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Yeah. His hair was some kinda crazy, too. Like, dreads! Or cornrows! Or... "
"whatever they call it. Anyway, I hope Kazuki-kun's okay. I'm awfully worried"
" about him!"
msgstr ""

